[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0010","text":"哇，好多小番茄！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0020","text":"对，大崎家产的……\n小番茄……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0030","text":"想和千雪小姐一起吃\n就带过来了☆"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0040","text":"请吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0050","text":"我开动了！／我开动了……！／我开动了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0053","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0060","text":"好、好硬……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0070","text":"嘿嘿……\n果然跟店里卖的不一样呢～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0080","text":"不过，因为是亲手种的\n所以这种地方，反而让人觉得有点可爱呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0090","text":"对了，要不要做成腌菜？\n可以保存，能慢慢享用……怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0100","text":"……！\n这个，赞成……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500300_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
